1
00:00:05,613 --> 00:00:06,913
小聲點 你會吵到莉莉
Shh! You'll wake Lily.

2
00:00:06,913 --> 00:00:07,883
你是有多醉啊
How drunk are you?

3
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:10,103
我跟你說三次她出去校外旅行了
I told you three times she's on that school trip.

4
00:00:10,103 --> 00:00:11,063
你要是不這么小聲說
I'd feel more confident

5
00:00:11,063 --> 00:00:12,883
-你的話會更有說服力一點 -你說得合理
- if you weren't also whispering. - Fair point.

6
00:00:12,883 --> 00:00:14,313
你... 你擦了口紅嗎
Are -- Are you wearing lipstick?

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,840
我是擦了指甲油嗎
Am I wearing nail polish?

8
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,160
我們算是出去瘋了一晚
So, we kind of had a crazy night out.

9
00:00:19,163 --> 00:00:20,693
本來一開始只是
It started off at this little

10
00:00:20,693 --> 00:00:23,003
去一家我聽人說的隱秘地下酒吧
under-the-radar speakeasy I heard about.

11
00:00:23,003 --> 00:00:25,423
他網上搜了"我家附近的酷酒吧"
Uh, he Googled "Cool bars near me."

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,060
反正呢 我們遇到了一幫20歲小年輕
Anyway, we met a group of 20-somethings

13
00:00:27,453 --> 00:00:28,693
大家相談甚歡
that took a shine to us.

14
00:00:28,693 --> 00:00:31,503
他們帶我們進入了地下派對
They introduced us to the world of underground parties

15
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,580
與一杯雞尾酒要18塊的世界
and $18 cocktails.

16
00:00:32,713 --> 00:00:33,923
-真的是太燒了 -是燃
- It was so burnt. - Lit.

17
00:00:33,923 --> 00:00:35,034
-太燃 -燃
- Lit. - Lit.

18
00:00:35,093 --> 00:00:37,762
我們去的這些酒吧 有半數我都記不得了
I don't even remember half these bars.

19
00:00:37,762 --> 00:00:39,312
我們昨晚還去了醫院嗎
Did we go to a hospital last night?

20
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,180
塔克奶奶的招牌解宿醉秘方
Okay, Grandma Tucker's hangover remedy --

21
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:44,040
在你的舌下放小塊黃油 把脖子往后仰
put a pat of butter underneath your tongue, tip your head back,

22
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,500
我把辣醬往你鼻子灌
and I'll pour the hot sauce up your nose.

23
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:46,660
等等等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

24
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,460
-是賓克發來的群短信 -什么
- That's a group text from Binker. - What?

25
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,520
-是的 -天啊
- Mm-hmm. - Oh, my gosh.

26
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,520
大伙們今晚還想再一起去派對呢
The gang wants to get back together and party tonight.

27
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,380
你還說他們看到我們
And you said we'd never hear from them

28
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,260
在丹尼酒吧燈光下的丑樣后 就會斷絕聯系
after they saw us in that horrible Denny's lighting.

29
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:59,480
我們的回應得百分百恰到好處
Okay, we have to play this exactly right --

30
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:01,180
不能顯得自己死命想巴著人家
We don't want to come off too eager,

31
00:01:01,232 --> 00:01:03,932
但又得讓他們知道我們愿意一起嗨
but we also want to let 'em know we're down to mob.

32
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,800
-要親命了 -小卡 你知道我們的規矩
- Oh, my God. - Cam, you know our rule,

33
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,100
絕對不連續兩晚出去野
we never go out two nights in a row.

34
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,640
-我知道 但這是... -我們今晚還要去
- Yeah, I know, but this is... - We're already pushing it

35
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,040
聽系列講座呢 這已經算很勉強了
by going to that lecture series tonight.

36
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,300
什么系列講座
What lecture series?

37
00:01:12,681 --> 00:01:14,541
美儲聯主席首席助手的講座
Alan Greenspan's top aide.

38
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:16,481
我們買了季票 因為我們想要最好的座位
We bought the season pass so we'd get premium seating

39
00:01:16,481 --> 00:01:18,671
去聽"幽默作家弗蘭·拉伯維治的諷刺之夜"
to "A Night of Sarcasm with Fran Lebowitz."

40
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:21,020
大家都要去呢
Oh, everyone's in.

41
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:24,040
還用了不同膚色豎拇指 年輕人就是反歧視
Look at all those thumbs of colors. They're so woke.

42
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,860
"我們不去 下次見"
"We're out. Catch you next time"?

43
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:27,240
米奇爾
Mitchell.

44
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,200
你怎么可以這樣
How could you?

45
00:01:29,211 --> 00:01:31,371
小聲點暴走 別吵醒莉莉了
Storm out softly. You'll wake Lily.

46
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,400
早啊 老婆 別在意我這一身加州理工裝備
Morning, honey. Don't mind all the Caltech gear.

47
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:52,580
我只是想給艾麗克斯驚喜 帶她去吃午飯
I figured I'd surprise Alex at school and take her to lunch.

48
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:55,680
學期末這時候你要去給她驚喜嗎
Surprise her? At the end of the semester?

49
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,680
親愛的 她應該在忙于各種期末考之中吧
Honey, she's probably in the middle of exams.

50
00:01:57,740 --> 00:01:59,580
她絕對會...
She's gonna be...

51
00:01:59,850 --> 00:02:00,861
欣喜若狂
thrilled.

52
00:02:01,220 --> 00:02:02,680
你有看過自己的錄像 是你在觀看時
Have you ever seen a video of yourself

53
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,760
才發現自己當時沒意識到穿著有多難看嗎
wearing something you didn't realize was unflattering?

54
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,120
我最近有了這樣的經驗
Well, that happened to me recently, and...

55
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,860
而難看的是我的性格
it was my personality.

56
00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:12,480
千百年來 人類一直渴望能像
For centuries, man has longed to rule the air

57
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,000
偉大的飛鼠般掌握騰空的能力
like the majestic squirrel.

58
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,300
一切將在今日終止
The wait ends today.

59
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,040
不行
Nope.

60
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,100
那如果我們...
Uh, but what if we --

61
00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:20,320
-一樣沒卵用 -媽
- Doesn't matter. - Hey, Mom.

62
00:02:20,340 --> 00:02:21,820
我戴這個是好看的對吧
I can pull this off, right?

63
00:02:22,049 --> 00:02:23,839
讓我來幫你調整
Let me. Oh.

64
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,460
我們不在家
Ah, we're not home.

65
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,860
我決定要不那么負面
I made a decision to be less negative.

66
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:33,880
這是嶄新的我 對一切都說"好"的女人
It's the new me, the girl who says "Yes."

67
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:36,340
朋友周末去墨西哥玩 在幫忙看
Friend went to Mexico for the weekend.

68
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,300
我還在拿捏那個平衡點
I'm finding the level.

69
00:02:39,019 --> 00:02:41,209
好帥啊 像《邁阿密風云》里似的
Crockett and Tubbs, you look snazzy.

70
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,560
謝謝... 你的話是稱贊吧
Thanks... I think.

71
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,940
我在試著打扮自己
I'm trying to step up my game.

72
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:45,360
我最近開始跟工作認識的一個人交往
I started seeing someone from work.

73
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,540
親愛的 我覺得呢
Oh, honey. I don't know

74
00:02:47,549 --> 00:02:49,439
跟工作認識的人交往感覺不太...
if I think that's such a good idea that --

75
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,600
沒事沒事 我贊成
Never mind. I approve.

76
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:57,480
如果我媽知道事情的全部 我不信她會同意
I doubt my mom would approve if she knew the whole story.

77
00:02:58,978 --> 00:02:59,799
泳池工
Pool boy.

78
00:03:00,038 --> 00:03:01,339
我這里需要新毛巾
I need more towels.

79
00:03:01,658 --> 00:03:02,809
女士 馬上來
Right away, ma'am.

80
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:14,720
搞定 我剛同意了另一個設計
Done. I just approved another design.

81
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,940
世界上最豪華的狗窩
The most luxurious dog bed yet.

82
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:18,080
我稱它為...
I call it...

83
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,060
狗窩之巔
The Top of the Bark.

84
00:03:19,488 --> 00:03:22,658
真好啊 你現在可以在家營運新公司
Ah, that's nice that you can run your new company at home

85
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,720
就能穿著只能在家穿的衣服了
in clothes that you can only wear at home.

86
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,300
當男人到了某個年齡后
When men get to a certain age,

87
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:29,500
他們就不再在乎外表
they stop trying.

88
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:30,920
我看過這情況了
I've seen it before.

89
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,320
先從服裝開始
First, it starts with the clothes,

90
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:35,440
然后是身材 最后是腦子
then the body, then the brain.

91
00:03:35,827 --> 00:03:37,467
但我不能跟杰提任何一點意見
But I can't say anything to Jay,

92
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,100
因為每當提到他的外表問題
because when it comes to his appearance,

93
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:41,240
他總是格外敏感
he's very sensitive.

94
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,020
親愛的 我回來啦
Mi amor, I'm back.

95
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,140
歡迎回來
Welcome home.

96
00:03:45,145 --> 00:03:47,797
你不喜歡 對吧
You hate it, right?

97
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,980
我去剃了 就是個笑話
I'll shave it. It's a joke.

98
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:50,100
我個傻逼
Stupid!

99
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,000
日安 各位
Good dawning, all.

100
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,600
我眼前的這是什么
What am I looking at?

101
00:03:54,837 --> 00:03:56,956
獸醫擔心你會咬自己嗎
Is the vet worried you're gonna bite yourself?

102
00:03:56,956 --> 00:03:58,626
這是傳統的都鐸式領子
It's a traditional Tudor collar.

103
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,560
我請求加入學校的伊麗莎白時代社團
I'm pledging my school's Elizabethan Society,

104
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:02,180
這是他們要求的入團羞辱儀式
and I have to wear this as a hazing ritual.

105
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,480
我覺得還行啊
I don't hate it.

106
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,780
我覺得這讓你的腦袋看起來
I think it makes your head

107
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:06,900
像是那種高檔餅干之類的
look like one of those fancy cookies.

108
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:09,720
我還得背誦幾段莎士比亞的獨白
I also have to recite several Shakespearean monologues

109
00:04:09,746 --> 00:04:12,336
然后給學校食堂加一點下流裝飾
and festoon our dining hall with some bawdy bunting.

110
00:04:12,336 --> 00:04:13,677
這年代的羞辱儀式是怎么回事
What happened to hazing?

111
00:04:13,826 --> 00:04:15,476
以前都是很爺們的玩法 你懂的
It used to be macho stuff, you know,

112
00:04:15,476 --> 00:04:17,906
比如讓人從你的肚臍眼喝烈酒
like making a guy drink a shot out of your belly button

113
00:04:17,906 --> 00:04:21,276
或者是大家屁股夾著橘子傳來傳去
or passing an orange around only using your butt cheeks.

114
00:04:21,276 --> 00:04:23,686
這可是學校里最難進的社團之一
Look. It's one of the most selective groups on campus.

115
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,160
我不想話說太早觸自己霉頭
I don't want to jinx it,

116
00:04:25,186 --> 00:04:26,696
但一周之后 我很有可能就在學習
but a week from now, I could be learning

117
00:04:26,696 --> 00:04:28,936
秘密小步舞曲的舞步了呢
the steps of the secret minuet.

118
00:04:28,936 --> 00:04:31,805
這就是學校消滅校園霸凌的后果
This is what happens when you eliminate campus bullying.

119
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,100
杰 你覺得如何
Jay, what do you think?

120
00:04:34,215 --> 00:04:36,675
我們去好餐廳吃頓午飯
We'll go out for a nice lunch,

121
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:38,280
稍微打扮一下
dress up a little bit.

122
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,580
這感覺是在攻擊我啊
This feels like an attack.

123
00:04:39,895 --> 00:04:41,625
我最多也只能婉轉到這個地步了
All right, that's as gentle as I can go,

124
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,280
我是哥倫比亞人 不是加拿大人
I am Colombian, not Canadian.

125
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,760
我剛收到俱樂部寄來的電郵
I got an e-mail from the club.

126
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,900
一些老人要在周間早晨占用我們的高球練習場
The older players have taken over the driving range

127
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,840
來練習室外地滾球
for bocce weekday mornings.

128
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:51,100
那又怎么樣啦 你們可以晚點再打高爾夫啊
So what? You can play golf later.

129
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,660
不行 我們有一個群組
No, we got a whole group --

130
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,700
叫日出揮桿手
the Sunrise Swingers.

131
00:04:54,095 --> 00:04:56,165
我們每天6點見面 打一桶球
We meet there at 6:00, hit a bucket.

132
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:57,800
群組里的一個女成員還要做背心制服呢
One of the gals is making up tank tops.

133
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,460
太好了 更多休閑服
Oh, yay. More casual clothes.

134
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:01,720
這樣不行 我要去俱樂部
No, I'm going down there,

135
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,280
尋求其他高球手的支持
get the support of some of the other golfers.

136
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:05,560
-或許我們還能搶回時間段 -好主意啊
- Maybe I can fight this thing. - Okay, good idea,

137
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:08,620
但別忘了俱樂部有著裝要求啊
but don't forget that there is a dress code at the club.

138
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,460
他們很可能已經撤銷這規定了
They probably already overturned it.

139
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,000
自從他們不再往小便斗里放冰塊
Ah, the whole place went to hell

140
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,420
那地方就一落千丈了
when they stopped putting ice in the urinals.

141
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,680
在尿尿時摧毀某樣東西
There's just something about destroying a thing

142
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,640
讓人有種成就感
while you're taking a pee

143
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:18,580
那令男人覺得自己雄風不減
that makes a man feel like a man.

144
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,440
你好啊
Oh, well, hello there.

145
00:05:23,714 --> 00:05:26,174
-爸爸 你怎么來啦 -你好
- Uh, Dad. What are you doing here? - Hi.

146
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:27,840
我想帶你去吃午飯
I thought I'd take you to lunch.

147
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,020
我不只是為了吃午飯
It wasn't just about lunch.

148
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:33,300
在三個孩子中 我一直覺得跟艾麗克斯最不親近
Of my three kids, I've always felt least connected with Alex.

149
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:35,240
我擔心我倆之間的距離
And I'm afraid that the distance between us

150
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,700
在她畢業后會越拉越遠
might grow after she graduates.

151
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,080
天啊 她快畢業了
Wow. Graduates?

152
00:05:40,313 --> 00:05:42,123
不過短短十年前
It was just, like, 10 years ago

153
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:44,020
她才第一次上大學課程
when she took her first college course.

154
00:05:45,023 --> 00:05:46,233
你應該先打電話說一聲的
I really wish you would've called.

155
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,360
我今天去不了吃午飯 我快遲到了
I can't go to lunch today. I'm late for...

156
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,920
-要參加個活動 -所以你打扮得這么漂亮嗎
- an event. - Is that why you're all dressed up?

157
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:52,500
對 不過沒什么大不了的
Yeah. But it's no big deal.

158
00:05:52,553 --> 00:05:54,863
對了 你看你們校報了嗎
B-T-dubs, have you seen your school paper?

159
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,960
你們畢業致辭的學生代表居然是只黑猩猩
Apparently, your valedictorian is a chimp.

160
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,780
這種大新聞怎么沒上頭條
How is that not bigger news?

161
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,520
這是假報紙 爸爸
It's a fake paper, Dad.

162
00:06:01,020 --> 00:06:01,980
這周是畢業生惡作劇周
It's senior prank week.

163
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,360
真希望我早點知道
Oh. I wish I'd known that

164
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,860
但我已經給你媽發了這條短信
before I sent your mom this text.

165
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:07,960
"猩猩開始進化了 快把香蕉藏好"
"It's starting. Hide the bananas."

166
00:06:11,660 --> 00:06:14,320
-鬧哪樣 -開普勒獎
- Seriously?! - The Kepler Award?

167
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,660
你就是要去參加這個嗎
Is this where you're going,

168
00:06:15,672 --> 00:06:17,952
看起來是很重要的獎項啊
'cause it looks like it's a big deal?

169
00:06:17,952 --> 00:06:20,222
只是給決賽選手辦的無聊歡迎會
It's just a boring reception for finalists.

170
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,780
我就喜歡歡迎會
Well, I love a good reception.

171
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,820
幾點開始
What time are we expected?

172
00:06:22,992 --> 00:06:25,072
我應該不能帶嘉賓入場
Oh, I don't think I'm allowed to bring guests.

173
00:06:25,072 --> 00:06:26,662
這里寫著"歡迎學生家屬出席"
Says here, "Families welcome."

174
00:06:26,662 --> 00:06:27,842
但我當時沒回復要帶
But I didn't RSVP.

175
00:06:27,842 --> 00:06:29,912
這里寫著"不必預約"
Says here, "Walk-ins encouraged."

176
00:06:29,912 --> 00:06:32,262
這傳單的信息量真足
What an informative flyer.

177
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,880
太棒了 我們去吧
Awesome. Let's do this.

178
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,760
瑜伽這玩意啊
Yoga, right?

179
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:42,540
沒有贏家 也沒有輸家
No winners, no losers,

180
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:44,080
沒有"誰最優秀"
no "Who's best?"

181
00:06:44,281 --> 00:06:46,961
你想要我告訴你 你是唯一一個
You want me to tell you that you are the only one

182
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,920
不需要老師幫助的人嗎
that didn't need help from the teacher?

183
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,140
真的嗎
Was I?

184
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,100
-詹妮絲 你好 -你好啊
- Janice. Hi. - Hi.

185
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:55,460
這位是克萊爾 我先生的女兒
This is Claire, my husband's daughter.

186
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,460
-你好 -你好
- Hi. - Hi.

187
00:06:56,601 --> 00:06:59,041
那歌洛莉亞應該算是你的繼母 對吧
So, that makes Gloria kind of like your stepmother.

188
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:00,500
對 但我們不搞這一套
Yeah, we don't do that.

189
00:07:00,561 --> 00:07:01,791
話說
Um, anyways,

190
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,700
你的新男友怎么樣
how is your new boyfriend?

191
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:05,180
很好
Pretty great.

192
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,120
不過我對于我倆的年齡差
I do feel a little awkward

193
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,620
是感到有些尷尬啦
about the age difference, though.

194
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:10,000
怎么個尷尬法
Ooh, which way are we talking?

195
00:07:10,171 --> 00:07:13,051
他...才20歲出頭
He's, uh, in his early 20s.

196
00:07:13,321 --> 00:07:14,801
爽爆了
Noice!

197
00:07:14,801 --> 00:07:16,190
差那么多不會尷尬嗎
Isn't that embarrassing?

198
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:18,240
才不會 勇敢去愛
No. I say go for it.

199
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,060
我喜歡這個新克萊爾
Ooh, I like this new Claire

200
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,960
她不會對每件事都持反對意見
that says "Yes" to things.

201
00:07:21,990 --> 00:07:24,200
換做以前 你會...
Before, you would be like, uh...

202
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:26,060
形容令人不爽怎么說來著
what is the word for grouchy?

203
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:27,600
現在這已經不重要了
I don't think it matters now.

204
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:29,680
20歲出頭小鮮肉啊
Early 20s, huh.

205
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,440
在那年紀 還沒被地心引力打敗
Well, you're still beating gravity at that point.

206
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:33,680
所有部位一定都在該在的地方 沒變形
I bet everything is right where it should be.

207
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,220
-沒錯 -是的
- Oh, yes. - Yeah.

208
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:38,710
看看他給我發的腹肌自拍
Check out this selfie he sent of his abs.

209
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,600
靠
Damn!

210
00:07:41,390 --> 00:07:44,340
跟注重自己外表的人在一起真好
It's so nice to be with someone who takes care of himself,

211
00:07:44,340 --> 00:07:46,050
不像我這年紀的男人 不修邊幅
not like the guys my age.

212
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,200
可不是嘛
Tell me about it.

213
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,960
杰開始有點不在意了
Jay's starting to give up a little bit.

214
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,520
從他穿的衣服就能看出來
You know, in the way that he's dressing.

215
00:07:50,569 --> 00:07:54,469
不如你把男友帶來我家 提醒一下杰
Why don't you bring your guy by the house to remind Jay

216
00:07:54,469 --> 00:07:57,409
女人喜歡努力維持外表的男人
that women like a man that make a little effort.

217
00:07:57,409 --> 00:08:00,089
-我們今天有空 方便嗎 -太棒了
- Um, well, we're free later today, if that works. - Perfect.

218
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:02,460
克萊爾 你也來 你就能幫我
And, Claire, you come, too, so that you help me

219
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,200
把杰推往正確的方向
nudge Jay in the right direction.

220
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,820
我可不希望我的第一次"拒絕"
Well, I wouldn't want my first "No"

221
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:08,520
-是對我繼母說的 -不是說了不搞這一套嗎
- to be to my stepmother. - I said we're not doing that.

222
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:12,020
小卡 快點
Cam, hurry!

223
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,320
我們到得夠早的話
If we get there early enough,

224
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,840
就能提交一個關于美儲聯主席的問題
we get to submit a question about Greenspan.

225
00:08:15,149 --> 00:08:16,449
我有個關于滯脹的好問題
I got a doozy about stag-flation.

226
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:17,600
-聽我說完 -你
- Just hear me out. - You...

227
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:20,200
-我們決定好了的 -不 是你決定好了
- We decided... - No, you decided.

228
00:08:20,349 --> 00:08:22,478
而且米奇爾 我們昨晚玩得那么開心
And, Mitchell, we had so much fun last night.

229
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:24,200
莉莉還有一晚才回來
Lily's gone for one more night.

230
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,800
咱們出去吧 走啦 找點樂子嘛
Let's go out! Come on. Have some fun.

231
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,420
打破我們的"連續兩晚"約定嗎
And break our two-night-in-a-row rule?

232
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,420
才不 絕不 我不要
No, no. I don't think so.

233
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,240
得了 你昨晚才睡了兩個小時
Okay, you slept two hours last night.

234
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:33,960
你知道當你太累時會撞墻上吧
You know you hit a wall when you get overtired.

235
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:36,580
-可不是鬧著玩的 -你知道我怎么想嗎
- It's very intense. - You know what I think this is?

236
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:38,240
我覺得你在擔心自己跟不上
I think you're worried that you can't keep up

237
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,440
我和我的青春活力
with me and my youthful spirit.

238
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,760
那天你還管冰箱叫冰盒子來著
The other day, you called a refrigerator an icebox.

239
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:43,440
那才不老 那叫鄉村風情
That's not old, that's country cute.

240
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:45,900
-行吧 -面對現實吧 你生來老成
- Okay. - Let's face it. You were born 50,

241
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:49,060
而我卻在內心永葆青春
and I've always been young at heart.

242
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:51,220
你知道嗎 也許這就是我們初次見面時
And you know what? Maybe that's what attracted you

243
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:54,200
我吸引你的原因... 我的少年魅力
to me in the first place... my boyish charm.

244
00:08:54,248 --> 00:08:57,157
而你則是個成熟滄桑的男人 來到我身邊...
And you were an older, seasoned man who came and...

245
00:08:57,657 --> 00:09:00,117
引誘我 羅賓遜先生
seduced me, Mr. Robinson.

246
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,940
好 行 這真是個"新潮"的比喻
Okay, yeah, that's a youthful reference.

247
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:04,000
你該和你的新朋友炫耀一下
You should trot that out with your new friends.

248
00:09:04,187 --> 00:09:05,897
小卡 你每次都是這樣
Cam, this is so you, okay?

249
00:09:05,897 --> 00:09:07,017
你把自己累垮了
You're running yourself ragged

250
00:09:07,017 --> 00:09:08,257
就為了證明自己還年輕
trying to remain young.

251
00:09:08,257 --> 00:09:10,667
我是說 接受自己變老了一點點這個事實
I mean, there's nothing wrong with accepting the fact

252
00:09:10,667 --> 00:09:11,817
沒什么不好的
that you're getting a little older.

253
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,760
除非你承認得太早
Unless you're admitting it too soon.

254
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,540
你不會想某天一拍腦袋想
You don't want to look up one day and think,

255
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,080
"我是不是忘了什么事"
"Oh, what did I forget to do?

256
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,820
"沒錯 享受生活"
"Oh, yeah. Live."

257
00:09:19,367 --> 00:09:20,987
行了 如果你要找我的話
Well, you know what? If you need me,

258
00:09:20,987 --> 00:09:23,767
我會在賓克家的暖身派對 就在...
I'm gonna be pre-gaming in Binker's loft in...

259
00:09:23,797 --> 00:09:25,607
一個廢棄的罐頭廠
an abandoned cannery

260
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:27,360
老泡菜街區那里
in the old pickle district.

261
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,040
感覺他家通風就很棒
Sounds drafty.

262
00:09:31,016 --> 00:09:32,516
好球
Nice roll.

263
00:09:32,516 --> 00:09:34,906
地滾球的戰局比我害怕的還要糟糕
The bocce situation was worse than I feared.

264
00:09:34,980 --> 00:09:36,200
我得把場地奪回到
I had to get the range back

265
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,760
日出揮桿手的手中
in the hands of the Sunrise Swingers.

266
00:09:38,996 --> 00:09:41,056
聽我說 這事別張揚
Listen, I, uh, got to be discreet.

267
00:09:41,056 --> 00:09:43,496
我似乎深入敵后了
Uh, I'm sort of behind enemy lines here.

268
00:09:43,746 --> 00:09:45,696
但是如果我沒搞錯的話
But, uh, if I'm not mistaken,

269
00:09:46,026 --> 00:09:47,476
你也是我們的一員
you're a fellow, uh,

270
00:09:47,856 --> 00:09:49,036
-揮桿手[換妻俱樂部] -你說什么
- "Swinger." - Excuse me?

271
00:09:49,036 --> 00:09:51,376
沒事沒事 我理解 只是...
No, no, it's okay. I'm cool. It's just that I, uh...

272
00:09:51,626 --> 00:09:53,187
我在試著搞點事情
I'm trying to get something started here.

273
00:09:53,216 --> 00:09:55,766
我是說 毫無疑問我們得秘密見面
I mean, uh, of course we have to meet in secrecy,

274
00:09:55,766 --> 00:09:57,436
但我也不介意在我家舉辦
but I don't mind hosting at my house.

275
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,700
-你不會真的在... -夫人 醒醒吧
- Are you actually suggesting... - Lady, wake up.

276
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:01,620
我們的生活方式正在遭襲
Our way of life is under attack.

277
00:10:01,820 --> 00:10:03,200
很快 我們人都湊不夠一場
Pretty soon, there won't be enough of us

278
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,100
完整的四人對抗賽[性愛]了
for a decent foursome.

279
00:10:04,260 --> 00:10:05,080
我得走了
I have to go.

280
00:10:05,525 --> 00:10:06,845
好吧 考慮一下我說的話
Okay. Well, just think about it.

281
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,340
-就這樣 你考慮考慮吧 -好
- That's all. Just think about it. - Okay.

282
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:10,560
-值得一試 是吧 -什么
- Worth a shot, huh? - What?

283
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,360
我才不是這個意思
No, that's not what I meant.

284
00:10:12,675 --> 00:10:14,745
這就是你們地滾球玩家所關心的嗎
Oh, that's what you bocce players are about, huh?

285
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:16,600
發現什么好的 就要毀掉它
You find something nice, and you ruin it.

286
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:20,680
那是施蒂格利茨博士
That's Dr. Stieglitz.

287
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,780
他有這個獎項贏家的最后決定權
He makes the final decision on the award.

288
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:25,560
他聰明又嚇人 令人過目難忘
He's brilliant and scary and impossible to impress.

289
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:27,160
我知道這話聽起來像老爸賣瓜
Hey, I know this is your dad talking,

290
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,580
但你自己也很聰明又嚇人
but you're pretty brilliant and scary

291
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:29,900
令人過目難忘啊
and impossible yourself.

292
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,300
好吧 我已經露過面了
Okay. I've made an appearance.

293
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:35,480
-我們應該可以走了 -別這樣 艾麗克斯
- I think we can go. - Come on, now, Alex.

294
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,820
這是為你舉辦的派對
This is a party in your honor,

295
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:38,760
況且你還帶著你私人的啦啦隊長
and you're here with your own personal cheerleader.

296
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,880
-爸爸 我只是... -我知道怎么激勵一群學者
- Dad, I just... - I know how to pump up an academic crowd.

297
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,540
我還激勵過一個辯論隊呢
I had to cheer for the debate team once.

298
00:10:42,784 --> 00:10:46,044
"要有說服力 要啊要有說服力"
"Be persuasive, B-E persuasive."

299
00:10:47,264 --> 00:10:49,044
-"要啊要啊..." -夠了
- "B-E P-E-R-S... " - That's enough.

300
00:10:49,834 --> 00:10:52,654
"媽的 干脆去問薛定諤的貓得了"
"Damn. Might as well ask Schrodinger's cat."

301
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:55,960
寵物啊
Pets.

302
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:59,180
我曾經養過一只能用遙控器的金剛鸚鵡
I once had a macaw that could use a remote control.

303
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:01,400
成天看有線電視 你也許會想...
Watched a lot of cable. You'd think, uh...

304
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:03,840
它會看動物星球 但它主要看的是電影頻道
You'd think Animal Planet, but it was mostly Cinemax.

305
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:05,060
我是艾麗克斯的爸爸
I'm Alex's dad.

306
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,060
艾麗克斯 過來這里
Alex, get in here.

307
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:10,580
實際上 我剛才指的是一個思維實驗
Actually, I was referring to a thought experiment

308
00:11:10,893 --> 00:11:13,613
關于量子力學中的一個悖論
concerning a paradox in quantum mechanics.

309
00:11:14,683 --> 00:11:16,883
是啊 妙哉妙哉
Yes, quite, quite.

310
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:19,940
你們都是哪里人啊
Where are you all from originally?

311
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,420
太讓人尷尬了
It was so embarrassing.

312
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,500
施蒂格利茨教授是個天才
Professor Stieglitz is a genius.

313
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:27,160
他才不會喜歡說著"妙哉妙哉"
He doesn't fall for people who pretend to understand him

314
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,960
來假裝聽得懂他的話的人
by saying things like "Quite, quite,"

315
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:31,420
或者"確實如此" 或者...
or, "Indeed," or...

316
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:33,000
有道理啊 兄弟
Touche, my good man!

317
00:11:33,733 --> 00:11:35,873
不過說真的 我有個科學問題
But seriously, I-I have a science question

318
00:11:35,873 --> 00:11:38,013
-我總是想不清楚 -要不就再想想
- I've always wondered about. - Uh, maybe keep wondering.

319
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,660
多少量的氦氣能安全地讓嬰兒
Would there be a safe amount of helium you could give a baby

320
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:44,140
從地面微微飄起呢
that would lift it off the ground?

321
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:44,780
什么
What?

322
00:11:45,132 --> 00:11:47,312
我不想讓他飄走
Oh. I don't want it to float away.

323
00:11:47,312 --> 00:11:49,162
我只想讓他玩得開心
I-I just want it to have fun.

324
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,880
我們能...
Can we...

325
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:56,880
你能幫我個忙嗎
Could you do me a favor?

326
00:11:57,260 --> 00:11:59,200
我今天有包裹要送到我宿舍
I'm having a package delivered to my dorm room,

327
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,860
需要有人留在那里簽收
and someone needs to be there to sign for it.

328
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:01,860
你室友做不了嗎
Can't your roommate do it?

329
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:03,520
不行 她被驅逐出境了
No. She got deported.

330
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,120
她不是從阿肯色州來的嗎
I thought she was from Arkansas.

331
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:07,780
是啊 但是她的父母是...賣國賊
