498
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:39,560
他在打電話 不過我得說一聲
Oh, he's making a phone call. Got to say, though,

499
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:42,420
我覺得有點尷尬 因為原來
I feel kind of awkward because, turns out,

500
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:44,220
-他跟歌洛莉亞有親戚關系 -什么
- he's related to Gloria. - What?

501
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:47,930
是我女兒 我得處理一下 抱歉
My daughter. I have to handle this. Sorry.

502
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:50,600
克萊爾 我有個大消息
Claire, I have big news.

503
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:53,120
老天 假如是我想的那個
Oh, God. If it's what I think it is,

504
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:54,900
我不知道你該不該這樣做
I don't know if that's a good idea.

505
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:56,400
我知道 人們會說
I know. People will say

506
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:58,540
我過于迷戀老舊的人和事了
I've taken my love of old things too far.

507
00:18:58,540 --> 00:18:59,540
但我很開心
But I'm happy.

508
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:02,440
不是我炫耀 但我是第一個進去的拉丁裔
And not to brag, but I'm the first Latino to get in there.

509
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,560
老天 我覺得我有點責任
Oh, boy. I feel sort of responsible for this.

510
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:08,140
我認為這更歸功于我的表現
Um, I think it has a little more to do with my performance.

511
00:19:08,300 --> 00:19:09,400
我表現十分杰出
I distinguished myself

512
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:11,220
所有的女性重點部分都被我征服了
when I did literally all the girl parts.

513
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:14,460
我得去往臉上潑點水
I need to go splash some water on my face.

514
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:17,160
等一下 你最近有在做仰臥起坐嗎
Wait a minute. Have you been doing sit-ups?

515
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,660
每晚都做 為了持久力
Oh, every night for stamina.

516
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:20,380
不然我不會表現得那么好
I would not have been able to perform without it.

517
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,300
我甚至還加入了一些舌頭練習
I even threw in some tongue exercises

518
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:23,760
因為我的悍婦[《馴悍記》]要好久才到高潮
because my "Shrew" was taking forever.

519
00:19:25,509 --> 00:19:26,608
老天
Oh, God.

520
00:19:26,608 --> 00:19:28,418
爸 你又在躲什么
Dad, what are you hiding from?

521
00:19:28,418 --> 00:19:29,768
等我告訴你我在俱樂部
You'll know after I tell you

522
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,280
和那女人說了什么 你就知道了
what I said to that woman from the club.

523
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:33,120
她怎么來了
What is she doing here?

524
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,620
-她是來讓你脫下這身衣服的 -你知道了啊
- She's trying to get you out of those clothes. - You know?

525
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,580
是的 我們在瑜伽課上談過了
Yes! We talked about it at yoga.

526
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:38,640
那是歌洛莉亞的主意
It was Gloria's idea.

527
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:40,560
我只是來當潤滑油作用的
I just came along to grease the wheels.

528
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,800
什么 你說這句前我本來差點要同意了
What?! I was almost considering it until you added that part.

529
00:19:44,088 --> 00:19:45,729
我得去往臉上潑點水
I gotta splash water on my face.

530
00:19:47,140 --> 00:19:48,980
這地方真冷清 想走嗎
This place is dead. Want to bounce?

531
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,540
不 我們不必和一大群人一起
No, we don't have to be around

532
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,120
才能玩得盡興啊
a big group of people to have fun.

533
00:19:53,908 --> 00:19:55,318
盧克 不
Luke, no!

534
00:19:55,318 --> 00:19:57,178
她有男朋友了
She has a boyfriend.

535
00:19:57,178 --> 00:19:58,508
是啊 就是我
Yeah, me.

536
00:19:58,520 --> 00:20:01,060
不 是俱樂部的某個小伙子
No, it's some young guy from the club...

537
00:20:01,600 --> 00:20:02,220
老天
Oh, boy.

538
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:08,040
歌洛莉亞 你知道曼尼的事嗎
Gloria, do you know what's going on with Manny?

539
00:20:09,367 --> 00:20:11,967
你認為他能藏住那個秘密嗎
Uh, do you think that he can keep that a secret?

540
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,720
他們不得不穿各種奇怪的衣服
They have to wear all kind of weird outfits

541
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,800
每次做起來都得穿
every time they do it.

542
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:17,440
媽
Hey, Ma.

543
00:20:19,180 --> 00:20:21,860
盧克 盧克 別碰曼尼的女朋友
Luke... Luke, get your hands off Manny's girlfriend.

544
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,680
-那不是我女朋友 -什么
- That's not my girlfriend. - What?

545
00:20:23,817 --> 00:20:25,317
那我們剛才討論的是什么
Then what were we just talking about?

546
00:20:25,317 --> 00:20:27,737
伊麗莎白時代社團 今晚第一次聚會
The Elizabethan Society. M-My first meeting's tonight.

547
00:20:27,737 --> 00:20:30,297
-我好糊涂 -再明白不過了
- I'm so confused. - It's plain as day.

548
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:33,280
這女人是過來和我玩換妻的
This woman is here to swing with me.

549
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,420
到此為止 這是我的底線
That's it. That's where I draw the line.

550
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:37,360
怎么會發生這種事
How did this happen?

551
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:38,960
我告訴你怎么會發生這種事
I'll tell you how this happened.

552
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:41,240
因為沒有人愿意當壞人
Because nobody was willing to say

553
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,820
說出逆耳的忠言
what needs to be said.

554
00:20:43,860 --> 00:20:45,740
不行 不行 不行
No. No. No.

555
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:46,960
絕對不行
And hell no.

556
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:55,800
那是你對得了B-的感覺 丹尼絲
It's how you feel about the B-minus, Denise,

557
00:20:55,860 --> 00:20:57,760
而不是你媽和我的感覺
not how your mother and I feel about it.

558
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,360
不 我沒不同意你去阿姆斯特丹
No, I'm not saying no to the Amsterdam trip.

559
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,660
是的 聽起來會是很好玩的暑假
Yeah, it sounds like a fun summer,

560
00:21:02,916 --> 00:21:05,775
但這寫在大學申請上好看嗎
but how is that gonna look on a college application?

561
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,660
我們稍后再談
We'll talk about it later.

562
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:09,960
我當然為你驕傲了
Of course I'm proud of you.

563
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:11,800
媽
Hey, Mom.

564
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:13,760
盧克 寶貝 你介意幫我拿一下
Hey, Luke. Honey, would you mind getting me

565
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:15,340
架子頂層的沙拉碗嗎
that salad bowl off the top shelf?

566
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:15,700
好的
Yep.

567
00:21:16,940 --> 00:21:18,020
我知道只有我喜歡
I know I'm the only one,

568
00:21:18,140 --> 00:21:19,680
但這是我的最愛
but it is my favorite.

569
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:22,600
不必道歉 老媽 你知道自己喜歡什么
Don't apologize, Mom. You know what you like.

570
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:24,380
算了 我不吃了
Never mind. I'm good.
